            /**
            Set bits to 1 to indicate which of the following extension fields contain valid data: bit 0: pitch, bit 1:
            roll, bit 2: aux1, bit 3: aux2, bit 4: aux3, bit 5: aux4, bit 6: aux5, bit 7: aux6
