        is Z-up, right handed (ENU). NaN or INT32_MAX may be used in float/integer params (respectively) to indicate
        optional/default values (e.g. to use the component's current latitude, yaw rather than a specific value). See
        also https://mavlink.io/en/services/mission.html.
