            A code that identifies the software component that understands this message (analogous to USB device classes
            or mime type strings). If this code is less than 32768, it is considered a 'registered' protocol extension and
            the corresponding entry should be added to
            https://github.com/mavlink/mavlink/definition_files/extension_message_ids.xml. Software creators can register
            blocks of message IDs as needed (useful for GCS specific metadata, etc...). Message_types greater than 32767
            are considered local experiments and should not be checked in to any widely distributed codebase.
