            Low level gimbal flags.
            */
            GIMBAL_DEVICE_FLAGS flags;
            /**
            Quaternion components, w, x, y, z (1 0 0 0 is the null-rotation). The frame is described in the message
            description. Set fields to NaN to be ignored.
