        The file CRC can be used for file caching.
        The general metadata file can be read to get the locations of other metadata files (COMP_METADATA_TYPE) and
        translations, which may be hosted either on the vehicle or the internet.
        For more information see: https://mavlink.io/en/services/component_information.html.
