            MAV_CMD_DO_SET_STANDARD_MODE, MAV_CMD_DO_SET_MODE or via RC). This should usually be the same as custom_mode.
            It will be different if the vehicle is unable to enter the intended mode, or has left that mode due to a
            failsafe condition. 0 indicates the intended custom mode is unknown/not supplied
            */
