            MAV_CMD_DO_DIGICAM_CONTROL = 203,
            /**
            Mission command to configure a camera or antenna mount
            ⚠ SUPERSEDED since 2020-01, replaced by MAV_CMD_DO_GIMBAL_MANAGER_CONFIGURE: The message can still be used to
